# API (`@umetrica/api`)

## Patterns

- Routes in `src/routes/*.ts`, register in `src/index.ts`
- Auth via `getAuthContext()` from `lib/request-auth.ts`
- Org scope: `organizationId` from session; never trust client tenant id
- Write ops: `canWriteDashboards(role)` — owner/admin only

## Database

- Schema files: `src/db/schema.ts`, `dashboards.ts`, `insights.ts`, `orders.ts`
- **Must list all schema files in `drizzle.config.ts`**
- Prefer Drizzle; `orders` table may use raw bootstrap SQL

## Auth

- Better Auth proxy at `/api/auth/*`
- Org plugin with roles: owner, admin, viewer (`lib/org-permissions.ts`)
- Email verification + password reset + invitation emails via `lib/email.ts`
- `POST /api/organizations` — create org with unique slug

## Env

Loaded from repo root `.env` via `apps/api/src/index.ts`.
